            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h3>Volunteer at Cumberland Heritage Village Museum</h3>
<p>Thank you for your interest in volunteering with us. By joining our team, you will play a vital role in bringing Ottawa’s local history to life. Our volunteers help deliver interactive educational programs, demonstrate heritage skills, and assist with various activities throughout the museum.&nbsp;We look forward to welcoming you to our volunteer team and working together to create memorable experiences for our visitors!</p>
