</ul>
<p>For more information, please contact our Customer Service Booking Clerk. Call <strong>613-580-2988</strong>&nbsp;or email <a href="mailto:museecumberlandmuseum@ottawa.ca">museecumberlandmuseum@ottawa.ca</a>.</p></div>
      
